{"seq":1,"slug":"recruit-channel-roi","title":"招商渠道 ROI 与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/recruit-roi-ops/recruit-channel-roi","wordCount":2580,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"招商渠道-roi-与成本\">招商渠道 ROI 与成本</h1><p>到了复盘的时候，招商负责人面对的第一个问题是：这个季度花的钱，值吗？这个问题看起来简单，实际上藏着一连串会把人带沟里的岔路。最典型的错误是把「渠道带来的 GMV」除以「渠道成本」当作 ROI——这个数会高得离谱，因为它把商家本来就会贡献的 GMV 也算进了渠道的功劳。</p>\n<p>本篇讲的是如何算出一个<strong>站得住脚的招商渠道投入产出比</strong>，以及为什么重要决策必须靠增量测试而不是观测式归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-成本该算什么\">核心概念：成本该算什么</h2><p>招商的成本边界是第一个必须钉死的东西。边界不统一，跨渠道比较就没有意义。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>是否计入招商 CAC</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>招商 BD 薪酬与提成</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>全成本（含福利与管理摊分）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道佣金/CPA 付款</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>按实际支付，含 clawback 调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动费用（展位/差旅/物料）</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>按活动归集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政策让步（费率/补贴/账期）</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>差额法，见 2.2 篇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KA 陪跑人力</td>\n<td>计入（单独挂账）</td>\n<td>见 3.3 篇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册与审核系统研发</td>\n<td><strong>不计入</strong></td>\n<td>平台级能力，非获客成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风控审核人力</td>\n<td>计入（分摊）</td>\n<td>与招商线索量强相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家成长/运营支持</td>\n<td><strong>不计入</strong></td>\n<td>属于入驻后赋能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后两行的划分最常引起争论。风控审核人力之所以计入，是因为它随招商线索量线性增长——招得越多审得越多；而商家成长支持不计入，是因为它发生在「可经营店铺」这个终点之后，属于另一条成本线。把这两条混在一起，会让招商 ROI 随着入驻商家的长期运营而持续恶化，最终无人敢招商。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CAC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的完整算法（借用 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Customer_acquisition_cost\">Customer acquisition cost</a> 的「复杂法」结构）是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>marketing</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>sales</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>Subsidy</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>PolicyCost</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>acquired</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CAC = \\frac{C_{\\text{marketing}} + W_{\\text{sales}} + \\text{Subsidy} + \\text{PolicyCost} + O}{N_{\\text{acquired}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3435em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">acquired</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">marketing</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sales</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Subsidy</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PolicyCost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>sales</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{sales}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sales</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 包含招商与审核人力的全成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span> 是其它直接相关费用。<strong>分母 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>acquired</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\_{\\text{acquired}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acquired</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的定义是这张表里最关键的决策</strong>——它决定了 CAC 的量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分母-什么样的商家才算-acquired\">分母：什么样的商家才算「acquired」</h2><p>如果把分母设为「签约数」，CAC 会非常好看；设为「入驻完成数」，会难看一截；设为「上架并动销数」，会更难看。这三个数之间的差距，恰恰是招商效率的真实损耗。</p>\n<p>推荐的默认口径是**「上架并产生首单」<strong>，理由是它对应到平台第一次拿到真实收益的正向信号，与 <a href=\"../recruit-roi-ops/recruited-merchant-quality\">入驻商家质量与存活</a> 的质量终点一致。同时必须</strong>并列展示另外两个口径**：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分母口径</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>签约数</td>\n<td>意向确认</td>\n<td>看商务能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入驻完成数</td>\n<td>通过审核</td>\n<td>看交接效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上架并首单</td>\n<td>可经营</td>\n<td><strong>默认 CAC 口径</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上架并持续动销</td>\n<td>质量商家</td>\n<td>战略口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个口径并列的价值在于，渠道之间的差异模式会立刻显现。一个渠道签约很多但首单转化很低，说明它带来的是<strong>低意愿商家</strong>；另一个渠道签约少但首单率高，说明它带来的是<strong>精准商家</strong>。用单一口径永远看不出这两种渠道的区别，只会看到两个不同的 CAC 数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成本归集的落地表结构\">成本归集的落地表结构</h3><p>上面的边界必须落到一张可审计的成本表上，否则每次复盘都要重新争论「这笔钱算不算」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE recruit_cost_entry (&#10;  id            BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  channel_id    TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  region        CHAR(2),&#10;  cost_type     TEXT        NOT NULL CHECK (cost_type IN&#10;                  (&#39;bd_payroll&#39;,&#39;channel_commission&#39;,&#39;event&#39;,&#39;policy_concession&#39;,&#10;                   &#39;ka_support&#39;,&#39;review_labor&#39;,&#39;excluded&#39;)),&#10;  amount_usd    NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  period_month  DATE        NOT NULL,&#10;  attribution   TEXT        NOT NULL,   -- direct / allocated / excluded&#10;  basis         JSONB       NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;,  -- 摊分依据: headcount / lead_count / gmv_share&#10;  entry_status  TEXT        NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;confirmed&#39;&#10;                CHECK (entry_status IN (&#39;confirmed&#39;,&#39;estimated&#39;,&#39;reversed&#39;)),&#10;  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON recruit_cost_entry (channel_id, period_month);&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX ON recruit_cost_entry (channel_id, cost_type, period_month, region)&#10;  WHERE entry_status = &#39;confirmed&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recruit_cost_entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  region        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cost_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bd_payroll'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'channel_commission'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'policy_concession'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                   'ka_support'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'review_labor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'excluded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_usd    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_month  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attribution   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- direct / allocated / excluded</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  basis         JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 摊分依据: headcount / lead_count / gmv_share</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_status  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'confirmed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry_status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'estimated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reversed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recruit_cost_entry (channel_id, period_month);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recruit_cost_entry (channel_id, cost_type, period_month, region)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>entry_status</code> 允许 <code>estimated</code> 与 <code>reversed</code> 是必要的：政策让步的成本在承诺期开始时只能估，clawback 追回时要落一条 <code>reversed</code> 冲销，而不是删除原始记录。<code>basis</code> 记录摊分依据（按人头、按线索数还是按 GMV 份额），因为同一笔共享成本用不同依据摊分，在不同渠道间会得到显著不同的 CAC——把依据写进数据而不是写进文档，才能复现历史口径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道-roi-的正确算法\">渠道 ROI 的正确算法</h2><p>有了 CAC，渠道 ROI 仍需处理分子——渠道带来的收益。这里的核心困难是归因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个层次的收益口径\">三个层次的收益口径</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>偏差方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>毛 GMV 归因</td>\n<td>渠道线索商家的 GMV 总和</td>\n<td>严重高估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台收入归因</td>\n<td>佣金 + 广告收入（不含补贴返还）</td>\n<td>高估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量收入</td>\n<td>实验估计的因果增量</td>\n<td>较准但难算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一层高估的原因有两重：GMV 不是平台的收入（要乘费率），且渠道线索商家的 GMV 里包含它们<strong>本来就会</strong>贡献的部分。第二层修正了第一重，但第二重仍在。只有第三层才是真正的问题答案。</p>\n<p>正确的 ROI 表达应当是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>IncrementalRevenue</mtext><mtext>TotalChannelCost</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROI_{\\text{channel}} = \\frac{\\text{IncrementalRevenue}}{\\text{TotalChannelCost}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TotalChannelCost</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IncrementalRevenue</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"为什么必须做增量测试\">为什么必须做增量测试</h3><p>观测式归因（把转化记给某个触点）本质上是在测<strong>相关性</strong>，不是因果。这个问题在营销归因领域已经被反复量化：多触点归因模型常与受控的提升测试（lift test）结论不一致，会高估那些本来就很可能转化的用户所看到的广告的作用，并受选择偏差影响，导致系统性的预算错配（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attribution_(marketing)\">Attribution (marketing)</a>）。营销组合建模（MMM）领域同样发现观测式模型经常显著高估真实的因果提升，因此引入实验校准（如 Predictive Incrementality by Experimentation 一类框架）来修正（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marketing_mix_modeling\">Marketing mix modeling</a>）。</p>\n<p>招商场景下这个偏差尤其危险，因为<strong>招商线索本身是高度选择性的</strong>：BD 会优先联系那些看起来最容易签的商家，而这些商家即便没有 BD 触达，也很可能自己搜索到平台并入驻。把所有签约都记给 BD，等于把自然增长算成招商成果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"增量测试的可行设计\">增量测试的可行设计</h3><p>招商做严格随机对照很难（不能真的不理会一部分目标商家），但有三种可行设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地理/市场对照</td>\n<td>同一批 BD 随机分配一部分市场不主动招商</td>\n<td>机会成本</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家级随机</td>\n<td>线索池随机分为触达组与保留组</td>\n<td>部分好商家被搁置</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间断点</td>\n<td>招商暂停/恢复前后的对比</td>\n<td>混淆季节与市场变化</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对照组预留</td>\n<td>保留 3%–5% 线索不触达作为基线</td>\n<td>直接损失</td>\n<td>强且可常态化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>推荐用于常态化的方案是「对照组预留」</strong>：从线索池里随机保留 3%–5% 不主动触达，作为自然入驻率的基线估计。这些商家里仍有一部分会自己找上门（这正是要测的），用这个自然率去校正所有渠道的归因，就等于给整套 ROI 上了一把校准尺。代价是直接放弃了那部分线索的招商机会，但它换来的是全盘数字的可信度——以 5% 的线索量换一个可信的基线，通常非常划算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[线索池] --&gt; B{随机分配}&#10;  B --&gt;|95-97%| C[触达组 走管道]&#10;  B --&gt;|3-5%| D[保留组 不主动触达]&#10;  C --&gt; E[签约/入驻/首单]&#10;  D --&gt; F[自然入驻率基线]&#10;  E --&gt; G[观测转化率]&#10;  G --&gt; H[增量 = 观测 - 自然率]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[渠道 ROI 分子]&#10;  J[渠道成本全成本口径] --&gt; K[渠道 ROI]&#10;  I --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[线索池] --&gt; B{随机分配}\n  B --&gt;|95-97%| C[触达组 走管道]\n  B --&gt;|3-5%| D[保留组 不主动触达]\n  C --&gt; E[签约/入驻/首单]\n  D --&gt; F[自然入驻率基线]\n  E --&gt; G[观测转化率]\n  G --&gt; H[增量 = 观测 - 自然率]\n  F --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[渠道 ROI 分子]\n  J[渠道成本全成本口径] --&gt; K[渠道 ROI]\n  I --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"回收期-比-roi-更稳健的指标\">回收期：比 ROI 更稳健的指标</h2><p>ROI 有一个实践上的缺陷：它依赖对收益的长期估计，而招商收益是逐步释放的。用<strong>回收期</strong>（payback period）可以回避这个问题——它只问「多久能收回 CAC」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>payback</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mtext>月均平台收入 per merchant</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{payback} = \\frac{CAC}{\\text{月均平台收入 per merchant}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payback</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月均平台收入</span><span class=\"mord\"> per merchant</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>月均平台收入取入驻后前 3 个月的月均值（剔除补贴返还部分）。回收期越短，招商的资金效率越高。它比 ROI 稳健的地方在于<strong>不需要预测远期</strong>——三个月的数据就能算出来，且不受折现率假设的影响。</p>\n<p>参考量级：LTV/CAC 的常见经验阈值是 3:1（低于 1:1 是亏的，高于 3:1 说明还有加投空间），对应的回收期通常在 12 个月以内（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Customer_acquisition_cost\">Customer acquisition cost</a>）。招商场景下应当按平台自己的资金成本与商家生命周期设定阈值，不要照搬。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道的横向比较与决策\">渠道的横向比较与决策</h2><p>有了统一口径的成本、三级分母和校准过的增量收益，就可以做渠道间的比较。比较的目的不是为了排名，而是为了<strong>决定预算怎么移</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>CAC（首单口径）</th>\n<th>回收期</th>\n<th>首单率</th>\n<th>增量占比</th>\n<th>决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>展会</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>14–20 月</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>待测</td>\n<td>保留头部展会</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代理商渠道</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>8–12 月</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>待测</td>\n<td>收紧质量闸门后观察</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>老商家推荐</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>3–6 月</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>待测</td>\n<td>加投</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BD 直接拜访</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>12–18 月</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>待测</td>\n<td>保留 KA 目标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「增量占比」一列写着「待测」是诚实的：<strong>在没有做增量测试之前，不该填一个编造的百分比</strong>。这张表的正确用法是先用 CAC 与回收期筛掉明显差的渠道，再用增量测试校准留存下来的渠道，最后做预算分配。跳过第一步直接做增量测试会浪费实验成本，跳过第二步直接分配预算会按错的比例分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>招商成本的边界必须钉死：BD 与审核人力计入，注册/审核系统研发与入驻后赋能不计入。</li>\n<li>CAC 分母默认用「上架并产生首单」，但必须并列展示签约、入驻、动销三个口径，才能看出渠道的差异模式。</li>\n<li>渠道 ROI 的分子必须是增量收入而非归因 GMV；观测式归因测的是相关性，招商线索的高度选择性会系统性夸大 BD 的贡献。</li>\n<li>常态化的增量测试方案是「对照组预留」3%–5% 线索不触达，用自然入驻率作为校准基线。</li>\n<li>回收期比静态 ROI 更稳健，因为它不需要预测远期收益。</li>\n<li>渠道比较先按 CAC 与回收期粗筛，再用增量测试校准，最后分配预算；未做测试前不要填编造的增量数字。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"recruited-merchant-quality\">入驻商家质量与存活</a> 处理 ROI 分子里最容易被忽略的部分：招来的商家能不能活。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"招商渠道 ROI 与成本","id":"招商渠道-roi-与成本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：成本该算什么","id":"核心概念-成本该算什么"},{"level":2,"text":"分母：什么样的商家才算「acquired」","id":"分母-什么样的商家才算-acquired"},{"level":3,"text":"成本归集的落地表结构","id":"成本归集的落地表结构"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道 ROI 的正确算法","id":"渠道-roi-的正确算法"},{"level":3,"text":"三个层次的收益口径","id":"三个层次的收益口径"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么必须做增量测试","id":"为什么必须做增量测试"},{"level":3,"text":"增量测试的可行设计","id":"增量测试的可行设计"},{"level":2,"text":"回收期：比 ROI 更稳健的指标","id":"回收期-比-roi-更稳健的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道的横向比较与决策","id":"渠道的横向比较与决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"重点品牌 KA 落地陪跑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/invite-conversion-handoff/key-account-white-glove"},"next":{"title":"入驻商家质量与存活","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/recruit-roi-ops/recruited-merchant-quality"}}